            "pk": "18096033538992347",
            "text": "We are thrilled to share some exciting news! 🚀\n\nDuring the Almaty Hub Open Day, an official memorandum of partnership was signed between ENACTUS Kazakhstan and Almaty Hub @almaty.hub.02 🤝 This collaboration was initiated by Almaty Hub, and we are proud to join forces with such a leading regional innovation platform that nurtures startups, entrepreneurship, and creative solutions.✊🏻\n\nAs the Kazakhstan chapter of ENACTUS, we bring together local students, academic leaders, and business professionals to develop entrepreneurial skills, launch impactful social projects, and support student-led startups. ENACTUS itself is an international non-profit that has been empowering students for 50 years across 33 countries, giving our local initiatives a global perspective.\n\nBy combining ENACTUS Kazakhstan’s local experience with Almaty Hub’s expertise, we aim to strengthen Kazakhstan’s innovation ecosystem and inspire the next generation of changemakers. 💡\n\nFor reference: Almaty Hub is inspired by Astana Hub, the largest international technopark of IT startups in Central Asia, which supports the development of innovation, technology companies, and startup ecosystems. 🚀\n\n#Enactus #EnactusKaz #WeAllWin #Innovation"
        },
